00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
JENNY: Hi, I'm
Jenny, and today I'm

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.830
going to discuss
AppSheet Automation,

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.670
the latest addition to Google
Cloud's no-code offerings.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.660
This powerful capability helps
anyone quickly and easily

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.110
automate manual tasks and
reclaim the most valuable

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.610
resource we have--

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.910
our time.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:19.830
Let's get started.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.752
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.820
We lose an estimated
20% of each week

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.300
to work that could and
should be automated.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.630
This is time that could be
spent on high-impact projects

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:43.130
or ideas but is lost to
manual, tedious tasks.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.460
Organizations need custom
solutions to help with this,

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.290
and they need them now.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.680
The demand for developers to
build these solutions, however,

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.470
far outweighs the
supply, leaving those

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.900
without development
knowledge or experience

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.970
to drive the solution
creation process.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.940
This means that
organizations need

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:05.690
to empower their workforce
with a no-code platform that

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.540
contains the intelligence
necessary to assist

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.480
in the development process
while adhering to governance

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.010
requirements.

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:16.730
Google Cloud's AppSheet allows
organizations of all types

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:19.010
and sizes to do just that.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.220
With the ease of no-code
and the power of AI,

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:25.640
the platform's intelligence
helps auto construct actions

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.610
based on a user's intent
to implement automations

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:31.160
quickly and easily.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:33.560
AppSheet Automation
is an extension

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:37.250
of AppSheet's platform to
offer new, integrated workflow

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.440
automation
capabilities that allow

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:42.080
you to automate common
business processes

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.660
and document-based workflows.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:49.040
It includes new components
like bots, events, tasks,

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.040
and processes that were
developed with modularity

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.320
and reuse in mind.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.290
The modularity takes
away additional steps

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:00.170
and allows people like
you and me to enlist

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:03.110
the assistance of bots
that simplify the creation

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.080
of workflows and processes.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.780
These bots help
automate tedious tasks

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.360
while keeping a
human in the loop.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.690
While there are numerous
possibilities to how automation

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:17.270
can shift the burden, there
are several components

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.970
where automation is a
rich capability that

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:24.470
can help improve efficiency
with document AI, modularity,

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:27.290
external eventing, and more.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.540
For now, we're going to
provide a walkthrough

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.780
of how quickly you can add
intelligent automations.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.890
Let's get started.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.010
Under the Automation
tab in your editor

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.230
is where you'll find your bots.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:41.780
Bots work with your
connected data source.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.990
In this case, we're
using Salesforce.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.750
Bots consisting of
events and processes

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.770
can be created or modified
with a few clicks of a button.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.500
Changes made are reflected in
real time in the app editor,

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.330
so you always know what
your automation consists of.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:02.660
Various data sources, such
as Salesforce and Sheets,

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.970
are also supported,
ensuring that you

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.700
can access the data you need.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.680
Have a unique use case?

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.870
Easily create unique
bots to trigger

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.910
any number of
powerful automations

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:16.640
to help remove manual tasks.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:20.990
Invoice processing, for
example, used to be tedious.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:24.050
With automation, you can
leverage intelligent document

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:27.770
processing to extract
information and notify someone

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.140
this action has been completed.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.260
Simply incorporate this
into your bot and AppSheet

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.270
will help with the rest.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.100
Whether you're
leveraging no-code

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.400
for custom applications or
time-saving automations,

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.370
the possibilities with
AppSheet are endless.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.350
Ready to change how you work?

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.850
Get started today by clicking
the link in the description

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:48.350
below.

